main.ua: "┌─╴core\n  Red   ← \"\\u001b[31m\"\n  Green ← \"\\u001b[32m\"\n  Blue  ← \"\\u001b[34m\"\n  Reset ← \"\\u001b[0m\"\n\n  ApplyColor ← (˜⊂ Reset ⊂)\n└─╴\n\n\n\n┌─╴legacy\n  # this is for getting the keys for the args\n  Getkeys     ← (≡(⊢ ⊜□ ⊸≠@= °□)↘1&args)\n  Getvalues   ← (≡(⊣ ⊜□ ⊸≠@= °□)↘1&args)\n  GetArgs     ← (map Getkeys Getvalues)\n  GetArgValue ← (⋕°□get□)\n\n  PrintUsage ← (\n    &p core~ApplyColor core~Red \"UCLAP legacy mode parser\"\n    &p core~ApplyColor core~Green \"Usage:\"\n    &p \"-------------------------------------------------\"\n    &p ⊂ \"takes a list of\" ⊂ core~ApplyColor core~Red\" key=value \" \"delimited by a space\"\n    &p \"example:\"\n    &p \"    uiua script.ua key=val key2=val2\"\n  )\n└─╴\n\n"

